lake/#upsert|docs\u003e.*\n\n:rotating_light: OLake UI v0.6.0 Released:rotating_light:\nRelease: \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-ui/releases/tag/v0.6.0|github.com/datazip-inc/olake-ui/…/v0.6.0\u003e\n*What’s New*\n• fix: pull MinIO images from olakego mirror (\u003chttp://quay.io|quay.io\u003e removed them too) by \u003c@U082APQJZNC\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-ui/pull/456|#456\u003e\n• feat: store target query engines and pass them to discover by \u003c@U08CR7HUWDC\u003e in \u003chttps://github.com/datazip-inc/olake-ui/pull/439|#439\u003e\n       → *For more details on target query engines, check out the \u003chttps://olake.io/docs/getting-started/job-level-properties/#2-target-query-engines|docs\u003e.*\n\nThanks for the contribution!",
